{"id":"6748c30f3a00f99a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-ax-generalization.md","title":"Generalization Rule (Gen)","display":"ax-generalization — Generalization Rule (Gen)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-generalization","aliases":["58-ax-generalization"],"display":"ax-generalization — Generalization Rule (Gen)","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[58-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-generalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-generalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-generalization — Generalization Rule (Gen)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (一阶公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (假设集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的自由变元, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"58-df-free-variable\">58-df-free-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\mathrm{Var_S}\">\\(x \\in \\mathrm{Var_S}\\)</span> (变量, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (假设集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2\\times\\mathrm{Var_S}\">\\(g\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2\\times\\mathrm{Var_S}\\)</span> (带绑定变量标记的规则实例)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GenRule}_S(g,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{GenRule}_S(g,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (概括规则实例谓词, 由本公理定义)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}\\)</span> (概括规则集, 由本公理定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}generalization} \\vdash \\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall g\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2\\times\\mathrm{Var_S}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{GenRule}_S(g,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists x \\in \\mathrm{Var_S}\\;(g=\\langle\\langle \\varphi,\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\rangle,x\\rangle \\land x \\notin \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma))\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}=\\{g \\in (\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2 \\times \\mathrm{Var_S}\\mid \\operatorname{GenRule}_S(g,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}generalization} \\vdash \\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\forall g\\in(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2\\times\\mathrm{Var_S}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{GenRule}_S(g,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\\exists \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists x \\in \\mathrm{Var_S}\\;(g=\\langle\\langle \\varphi,\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\rangle,x\\rangle \\land x \\notin \\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma))\\Bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Gen}_{\\Gamma,\\Sigma}=\\{g \\in (\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2 \\times \\mathrm{Var_S}\\mid \\operatorname{GenRule}_S(g,\\Gamma,\\Sigma)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gen is encoded as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{premise},\\mathrm{conclusion}\\rangle,\\mathrm{bound\\ variable}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\langle\\mathrm{premise},\\mathrm{conclusion}\\rangle,\\mathrm{bound\\ variable}\\rangle\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Gen} \\subseteq (\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2 \\times \\mathrm{Var_S}\">\\(\\mathrm{Gen} \\subseteq (\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma))^2 \\times \\mathrm{Var_S}\\)</span></li>\n<li>The eigenvariable side condition is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> may occur freely in the premise <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-